{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12105060","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1210506001:1":{"text":"왜 이렇게 빨리 내려왔어? 방에 무슨 문제라도 있어?","source_cn":"怎么这么快就下来了？房间有问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35F430CACFA57E17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210506002:1":{"text":"신밧드, 보르스가 우리를 속이고, 우리가 물귀신이라고 고발당한 게 전부 당신이 벌인 짓이었군요?","source_cn":"辛巴达，我们被波尔斯坑骗，被举报成水鬼，原来都是你在背...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E602137D7C26AD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210506003:1":{"text":"다... 들었어?","source_cn":"你们……听到了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC099F6381982D34A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1210506003":{"text":"다... 들었어?","source_cn":"你们……听到了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC099F6381982D34A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210506004:1":{"text":"왜 우리를 속인 거죠? 치피의 목숨을 구해준 당신을... 친구라고 생각하고 싶었는데!","source_cn":"为什么要骗我们，你救了满满，我……我想把你当朋友的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55388EC0170E4A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210506005:1":{"text":"휴... 오해야. 너희가 러스트 항에 올 때 타고 왔던 배에 물귀신의 깃발이 있었지? 해변에서 너희를 구할 때 봤어.","source_cn":"唉……这是个误会，你们来锈锚港的船上不是有个水鬼的旗帜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57337CD2005AC17A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210506006:1":{"text":"그... 발톱에... 뼈다귀같이 생긴 깃발이요?","source_cn":"就是那个有点像……爪子又有点像……骨头的旗子？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B0D7D5F2D534925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210506007:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈는 물귀신파의 배를 타고 있는 사람을 모두 물귀신파라고 단정 지어. 정보를 제공해 주면 러스트 항을 보호할 수도 있고, 이득도 좀 취할 수도 있지...","source_cn":"坐着水鬼帮的船，就是水鬼帮的人——在血薇帮的判断里，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74970EF9BE11C56A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210506008:1":{"text":"그건 크나큰 오해예요. 그 배는 주운 거라고요!","source_cn":"这是个大误会，那艘船我们是捡到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74750FE2C661BB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1210506008":{"text":"그건 크나큰 오해예요. 그 배는 주운 거라고요!","source_cn":"这是个大误会，那艘船我们是捡到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74750FE2C661BB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_tit